{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29114","headline":"卢山人自巴蜀由湘潭归茅山因赠 · 许浑","name":"卢山人自巴蜀由湘潭归茅山因赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太乙灵方链紫荷，紫荷飞尽髪皤皤。\n猨啼巫峡晓云薄，鴈宿洞庭秋月多。\n导引岂如桃叶舞，步虚宁比竹枝歌。\n华阳旧隐莫归去，水没芝田生绿莎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29114.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29114","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}